{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16224140","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16224140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1622414001:1":{"text":"うーん、最高の肉の香りやのぉ……まるでババリアの宴のようで食欲をそそる！","source_cn":"唔……这烤肉的味道太棒了，就像蛮血部落的篝火宴一样诱人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23F4434BC9B0BA21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1622414002:1":{"text":"ホープの顔に満足げな表情が浮かぶ。かなり料理を気に入ったようだ。","source_cn":"赫普脸上带着心满意足的神态，看来这份烤肉确实合他心意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26F98434BE550A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1622414003:1":{"text":"これはお父さんの得意料理なんです！","source_cn":"这可是我爸爸的拿手好菜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43C966230FFF0053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1622414003":{"text":"これはお父さんの得意料理なんです！","source_cn":"这可是我爸爸的拿手好菜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43C966230FFF0053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1622414004:1":{"text":"そんな見くびらんでほしいのぉ。まあ……誰かが気にかけてくれちょるのは、悪うないけどな。ソリス先生はいつも親切やけぇ。","source_cn":"怎么会出意外，我这不是好好的？不过……有人惦记的感觉倒...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB27C7D149FE896DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"そんな見くびらんでほしいのぉ。まあ……誰かが気にかけてくれちょるのは、悪うないけどな。ソリス先生はいつも親切やけぇ。","female":"そんな見くびらんでほしいのぉ。まあ……誰